OL,3,AUse all powers necessary on
OL,4,Aanti-migrant protests, home secretary
OL,5,Atells police
OL,6,
OL,7,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood has told
OL,8,Fpolice chiefs that lessons must be
OL,9,Flearned from how they handled last
OL,10,Fweekend's anti-migrant protests in
OL,11,FDover and Portsmouth - saying she
OL,12,Fexpects officers to use all powers
OL,13,Fnecessary.
OL,15,FIn a meeting on Thursday she asked for
OL,16,Freassurance that plans were in place
OL,17,Ffor the police to move quickly and
OL,18,Feffectively in dealing with far-right
OL,19,Fgroups seeking to intimidate
OL,20,Fcommunities.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
